{"blocks": [{"type": "Title", "element_id": "19f8b7b0c65a18ecf1a5607ce846becf", "text": "秦皇岛银行数据安全管控平台\n串联部署健康检查方案", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Title", "languages": ["kor", "zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "7bfdab00af2b6a5e09517eace2f08d9e", "text": "方案版本 1.0    2026年10月22日", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "19f8b7b0c65a18ecf1a5607ce846becf"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "6f7eb339b0152559d544ffbce10827ac", "text": "1 方案目标与部署架构", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "a18f1c8dce773cda3f8ff28e79e73e03", "text": "串联部署中，平台位于业务访问链路上。建议采用双向健康检查：由 F5 检查数据安全管控平台的端口与 HTTP 健康接口，由平台主动检查后端业务节点，配合多节点切换、故障告警和恢复等待，降低单节点异常对业务的影响。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "6f7eb339b0152559d544ffbce10827ac"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "5594804da3d8e47219bfcc67fa69df92", "text": "端口连通只表示网络与监听可响应，不能证明完整业务可用；平台健康接口也应按其实际检查范围解释，避免将局部检查结果扩大为全链路健康结论。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "6f7eb339b0152559d544ffbce10827ac"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "3058c1322017afe71d2c28cf7cbb95cc", "text": "图1 串联部署双向健康检查总体方案", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Caption", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "6f7eb339b0152559d544ffbce10827ac"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "bbd63facc358e830dedcbccc17c176cc", "text": "业务流向：业务客户端 → F5 → 数据安全管控平台集群 → 后端业务系统。平台与后端均建议配置冗余节点，F5 按成员执行检查，故障后优先切换到其他健康平台节点。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "6f7eb339b0152559d544ffbce10827ac"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "ef7341dbbef35626ac13d766fb388651", "text": "2 双向健康检查机制", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "0093924ac18e743c1c56266daf8f351d", "text": "2.1 F5 检查数据安全管控平台", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["kor", "zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ef7341dbbef35626ac13d766fb388651"}}, {"type": "Table", "element_id": "a06ceebdf670988d7b6223ed32a8ca8e", "text": "检查项 方式与成功条件 检查范围 业务端口 TCP 连接实际业务监听端口 网络可达、监听和连接能力 平台健康接口 GET http://成员IP:8070/health\n200 且正文为 {\"data\":\"OK\"} 内部服务可响应、配置同步状态标志为成功", "metadata": {"emphasized_text_contents": ["检查项", "方式与成功条件", "检查范围"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "text_as_html": "<table><tr><td>检查项</td><td>方式与成功条件</td><td>检查范围</td></tr><tr><td>业务端口</td><td>TCP 连接实际业务监听端口</td><td>网络可达、监听和连接能力</td></tr><tr><td>平台健康接口</td><td>GET http://成员IP:8070/health 200 且正文为 {&quot;data&quot;:&quot;OK&quot;}</td><td>内部服务可响应、配置同步状态标志为成功</td></tr></table>", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "0093924ac18e743c1c56266daf8f351d"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "044562a1211e10d68d96f7be62e2e0df", "text": "当前健康接口在配置同步状态标志不为成功时，返回 HTTP 406 和 {\"data\":\"FAIL\"}。它不是完整运行时自检，不直接验证所有规则、后端依赖或脱敏处理结果。8070 为内部服务端口，应仅允许监控网络访问。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "0093924ac18e743c1c56266daf8f351d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "4ecd7745b898ab2ee7f51197545710ec", "text": "2.2 平台主动检查后端业务节点", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["kor", "zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ef7341dbbef35626ac13d766fb388651"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "764a53d1d9003b3f7304487ca58d7bdc", "text": "开启应用的健康检查后，对配置有效且节点数大于 1 的后端，平台按节点启动检查任务：启动时立即发送 HTTP GET，随后按间隔定时触发。连接失败、请求超时、请求错误或最终响应状态码非 2xx 时判定失败；请求成功且最终状态码为 2xx 时判定成功。当前实现不校验响应正文。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4ecd7745b898ab2ee7f51197545710ec"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "da3b2d2275fbbcd9849011a70a6ecf17", "text": "检查结果用于维护健康节点列表，并供负载均衡选择。达到失败阈值后移出列表，达到恢复阈值后重新加入。后端健康接口应反映自身关键处理路径及依赖的就绪状态，正常返回 2xx，异常返回非 2xx；不可始终固定返回 200。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4ecd7745b898ab2ee7f51197545710ec"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "3e77c618a100ba19d3c4f3ee15a7f81a", "text": "2.3 端口存活但业务异常的处理", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "ef7341dbbef35626ac13d766fb388651"}}, {"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "16970c8c15462b83285e9da416a91188", "text": "若后端端口仍在监听，但业务处理已异常，应通过后端 HTTP 健康接口的非 2xx 响应表达异常；若接口始终返回 200，当前平台无法仅从端口或正文中的错误提示识别该故障。HTTP 客户端默认跟随重定向，健康地址应避免跳转至登录页后返回 200。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "3e77c618a100ba19d3c4f3ee15a7f81a"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "f11d303699e9b0f9faf51655aa29fa81", "text": "TCP 握手不能证明应用处理正常；UDP 无连接握手，发送成功或未收到错误不能视为业务健康。当前核对实现提供 HTTP 主动检查，未确认独立 TCP 或 UDP 主动检查配置，也不能承诺真实请求一次失败就立即剔除节点。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "3e77c618a100ba19d3c4f3ee15a7f81a"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "01e3a6a5405ab98ebc34a2fa88a71b47", "text": "3 F5 配置与切换建议", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "4483f4799b4828bb234f9a5ef4f17d44", "text": "3.1 监控对象与请求内容", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "01e3a6a5405ab98ebc34a2fa88a71b47"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "147672eb9c125dd1798831ac0731491a", "text": "为每个业务服务池成员配置监控，直接探测该成员 IP，避免通过公共 VIP 被其他健康成员响应。TCP 监控访问业务端口；HTTP 监控访问同一成员 IP 的 8070 别名端口。若采用组合判定，应要求所有指定监控均通过。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4483f4799b4828bb234f9a5ef4f17d44"}}, {"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "4687e8199a14ed1caf2a2d1bf628cea5", "text": "HTTP Send 示例：GET /health HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: platform.bank.example\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n。部署时替换真实 Host，并按 F5 界面的格式输入换行。Receive 匹配唯一正文 {\"data\":\"OK\"}，同时确认状态码判定。Send 与 Receive 均需设置，避免退化为简单连接检查。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["eng"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4483f4799b4828bb234f9a5ef4f17d44"}}, {"type": "Table", "element_id": "a62a9eb0fa804c6947aa59eda6e31150", "text": "F5 参数 联调起点 含义 Interval 5 秒 监控发送间隔 Timeout 16 秒 成员判死时间配置，不是平台单次请求超时 Time Until Up 10 秒 首次正确响应后的恢复等待时间，不是成功次数", "metadata": {"emphasized_text_contents": ["F5 参数", "联调起点", "含义"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "text_as_html": "<table><tr><td>F5 参数</td><td>联调起点</td><td>含义</td></tr><tr><td>Interval</td><td>5 秒</td><td>监控发送间隔</td></tr><tr><td>Timeout</td><td>16 秒</td><td>成员判死时间配置，不是平台单次请求超时</td></tr><tr><td>Time Until Up</td><td>10 秒</td><td>首次正确响应后的恢复等待时间，不是成功次数</td></tr></table>", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4483f4799b4828bb234f9a5ef4f17d44"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "7be9d6d51057a10b079d1a18e032499c", "text": "以上为 F5 联调参考值，需按 BIG-IP 版本、拓扑、业务耗时及切换目标验证；与最后配置截图中的平台超时 15 秒分别设置，不能混用。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "4483f4799b4828bb234f9a5ef4f17d44"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "1479a85b3f892cf6dfa15c89b2b28244", "text": "3.2 切换与恢复", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "01e3a6a5405ab98ebc34a2fa88a71b47"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "be5a292fc9693c640e0310ccfe226270", "text": "成员判为异常后停止向其分配新连接，优先切换至其他健康平台节点。已有 TCP 或 TLS 会话不能保证无损迁移，应结合持久化、长连接和 Action on Service Down 验证处理策略，非幂等交易不得未经业务控制透明重放。全部平台节点故障时，应明确受控拒绝或切换备用脱敏集群的策略；直连绕过脱敏须由客户明确批准。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "1479a85b3f892cf6dfa15c89b2b28244"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "765139d09ec803ed9c00910280edaa4f", "text": "3.3 上线前需要确认的实现边界", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "01e3a6a5405ab98ebc34a2fa88a71b47"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "0077ccd6597bb084eebb06e5505fecc6", "text": "当前核对代码存在三项边界：单后端不启动主动检查；全部后端不健康时回退到原始节点列表；相反结果未清零既有阈值计数，尚不严格符合界面的“连续”语义。须在交付版本中核实并修正、验收，不能直接承诺“不健康节点绝不被选择”。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "765139d09ec803ed9c00910280edaa4f"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "d22e1e255aedc74ec0cde1b6b111f05e", "text": "联合验收应覆盖平台进程停止、业务端口不可达、健康接口异常、单后端及全后端故障、交替成功失败、恢复抖动和长连接中断，并记录发现时间、切换时间、失败请求数与恢复时间。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "765139d09ec803ed9c00910280edaa4f"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "b068da5095ff1ee53d15adf439d67b77", "text": "F5 参考资料：https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/icontrol-rest/APIRef_tm_ltm_monitor_http.html", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "765139d09ec803ed9c00910280edaa4f"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "fc7ac5458a6444020a31b44a1a6cf7ba", "text": "4 平台配置操作说明", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "70347768bc0ca8a885fdb580b91fdd48", "text": "4.1 开启代理模式与健康检查", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "fc7ac5458a6444020a31b44a1a6cf7ba"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "1cc3f8d13b248acabde65ee54d0026ec", "text": "进入目标应用编辑页面，选择代理模式，核对上游服务器和路径改写配置，再开启健康检查。下面嵌入实际界面截图；其中健康检查字段尚未填写，参数取值见下一页。截图仅展示一个上游地址，若需利用当前多节点主动检查与选择能力，应配置至少两个可独立服务的后端节点。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "70347768bc0ca8a885fdb580b91fdd48"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "cfb763d2ad143d59d3f0da202a5437fa", "text": "图2 代理模式与健康检查实际配置界面", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Caption", "languages": ["kor", "zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "70347768bc0ca8a885fdb580b91fdd48"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "c1a8da84b929c9949a4889dce96d8ae2", "text": "健康检查地址填写后端实际可访问的相对路径，由平台与每个上游地址拼接。截图中的 /sqlibench/ → / 为正常代理请求的路径改写，健康检查地址需按后端实际路径单独核实。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "70347768bc0ca8a885fdb580b91fdd48"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "adaf5a3d86f3f2ad4bd1470cc1524e80", "text": "4 平台配置操作说明", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 1", "languages": ["kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "187610834edb6a4883234e3d8c9c7c4d", "text": "4.2 实际参数与配置含义", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "adaf5a3d86f3f2ad4bd1470cc1524e80"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "9c8534a35613fdd8e27cab5e451ce527", "text": "图3 实际健康检查参数截图", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Caption", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "187610834edb6a4883234e3d8c9c7c4d"}}, {"type": "Table", "element_id": "57cf2c06b99e58b5c6fbf0010d377adf", "text": "配置项 截图值 含义与注意事项 间隔时间 10 秒 按配置间隔触发主动 HTTP 检查 超时时间 3 秒 单次 HTTP 检查允许的最长时间 成功判定 连续成功 ≥ 2 次 界面表达的恢复阈值；交付前验证连续计数语义 失败判定 连续失败 ≥ 3 次 界面表达的故障阈值；交付前验证连续计数语义", "metadata": {"emphasized_text_contents": ["配置项", "截图值", "含义与注意事项"], "emphasized_text_tags": ["b", "b", "b"], "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "text_as_html": "<table><tr><td>配置项</td><td>截图值</td><td>含义与注意事项</td></tr><tr><td>间隔时间</td><td>10 秒</td><td>按配置间隔触发主动 HTTP 检查</td></tr><tr><td>超时时间</td><td>3 秒</td><td>单次 HTTP 检查允许的最长时间</td></tr><tr><td>成功判定</td><td>连续成功 ≥ 2 次</td><td>界面表达的恢复阈值；交付前验证连续计数语义</td></tr><tr><td>失败判定</td><td>连续失败 ≥ 3 次</td><td>界面表达的故障阈值；交付前验证连续计数语义</td></tr></table>", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "187610834edb6a4883234e3d8c9c7c4d"}}, {"type": "Title", "element_id": "bfb3d9478a6530dcd0400024c0cb74cb", "text": "4.3 参数联调与保存验证", "metadata": {"category_depth": 1, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Heading 2", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "adaf5a3d86f3f2ad4bd1470cc1524e80"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "f9b9481b849efe40c23c8294566c2201", "text": "保存前确认健康检查地址可从平台节点直接访问，正常返回 2xx、异常返回非 2xx，且无需跳转登录。保存后观察每个后端的健康状态和日志，通过断开单节点端口、返回非 2xx、制造超时与恢复等方式验证状态变化。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "bfb3d9478a6530dcd0400024c0cb74cb"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "bfd882152ffe9c07ed6fa025824abf2a", "text": "验收时特别验证单节点与全部节点故障策略，以及交替成功失败是否按连续阈值处理；在这些实现边界完成确认前，不应仅凭配置界面开启状态判断已具备完整故障摘除能力。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "bfb3d9478a6530dcd0400024c0cb74cb"}}, {"type": "UncategorizedText", "element_id": "0f8d8912438dc5e48ac906f89bbaa8a6", "text": "健康检查能够降低串联部署的故障影响，无法替代集群冗余、运行监控与故障演练，也不能保证零中断。", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "last_modified": "2026-10-26T15:35:26", "style_name": "Normal", "languages": ["zho", "kor"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "parent_id": "bfb3d9478a6530dcd0400024c0cb74cb"}}, {"type": "Footer", "element_id": "72ee67af2217ea0209fef5e962e3c5dd", "text": "秦皇岛银行  |  健康检查方案", "metadata": {"category_depth": 0, "file_directory": "/Users/mac/Developer/src/python/privacy-react-demo/research/document-parser-benchmark/corpus/docx", "filename": "fbcc052ee24769ba3bfb85f4324cbdaecb9fbae2a98a47bf199a27a0f81d470d.docx", "header_footer_type": "primary", "languages": ["kor", "zho"], "filetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"}}]}